    cineris-session::it put_back::unix::the_same_content_with_a_wider_mode_is_still_put_back

[break] a-file-made-private-since-is-opened-up-on-windows
rule: On Windows a file the person made private since stays private when a rewind writes over it, whatever the checkpoint kept.
